// Tours Nostr Lab in muted headless Chrome, as a player does: every station in the tour's order, its
// lesson finished, the address following, a picture of each (coax/web/lab-tour.coax has the tour and
// its options).
//   coax/web/tool.sh nostr-lab-check [BASE_URL] [OUT_DIR] [--size WxH] [--scale N] [--dwell SECONDS]
//       [--from N] [--to N] [--frames] [--no-pictures] [--screenshots] [--turn PIXELS] [--lift PIXELS]
#load "lab-tour.coax";
// Its first four stations (a key pair, an event, its ID, its signature) are worked out as the page
// starts; each station after them is a card with a state of its own (nostr-lab-walk.coax nostr_probe).
tool_main :: () -> int #export_c #effects(all) { return lab_tour_main("nostr-lab", "Nostr Lab", 4); }
